## Login Flow


const user = await getUser(email);

const isMatch = await bcrypt.compare(
  password,
  user.userPassword,
);

if (!isMatch) {
  throw new UnauthorizedException();
}


* Fetch user.
* Compare entered password with hashed password.
* Throw exception if password is invalid.

