## JWT Generation


const payload = {
  email: user.email,
};

const token =
  this.jwtService.sign(payload);

return {
  access_token: token,
};


* Create payload.
* Generate JWT token.
* Return token to client.



## Auth Guard


@UseGuards(AuthGuard('jwt'))
@Get('profile')
getProfile() {
  return 'Protected Route';
}
```

* Intercepts request.
* Validates JWT token.
* Allows access only for authenticated users.

